   "label": "Hero about: The Applied AI Engineering Partner for Established Software",
   "scope": "page",
   "skipped": false,
   "text": "Background\nBackground\nBackground\nAPPLIED AI ENGINEERING PARTNER\nThe Applied AI Engineering Partner for Established Software\nGoGloby is an Applied AI Engineering partner. We turn engineering into AI-native production for established software companies, making every AI dollar visible, shipping features at AI speed against your own baseline, and growing the return every month.",
